{"id":"51c37ed4074fa310","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-ideal6-generated-ideal.md","title":"ZFC Ideal6 Generated Ideal","display":"df-zfc-ideal6-generated-ideal — ZFC Ideal6 Generated Ideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ideal6-generated-ideal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ideal6-generated-ideal"],"display":"df-zfc-ideal6-generated-ideal — ZFC Ideal6 Generated Ideal","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch05/58-df-ideal]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ideal6-generated-ideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ideal6-generated-ideal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ideal6-generated-ideal — ZFC Ideal6 Generated Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal\">../batch05/58-df-ideal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite\">../batch04/58-df-finite</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal B,\\mathcal I\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal B,\\mathcal I\\in V\\)</span> (base set, generating family, and generated-ideal candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}\\)</span> (set-ideal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal\">../batch05/58-df-ideal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> (finite-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite\">../batch04/58-df-finite</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6GeneratedIdeal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6GeneratedIdeal}_S\\)</span> (generated-ideal predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal6\\text{-}generated\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6GeneratedIdeal}_S(X,\\mathcal B,\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\n\\mathcal I=\\{A\\subseteq X:\\exists\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal B\\;\n(\\mathrm{Finite}(\\mathcal C)\\land A\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal C)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal6\\text{-}generated\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6GeneratedIdeal}_S(X,\\mathcal B,\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\n\\mathcal I=\\{A\\subseteq X:\\exists\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal B\\;\n(\\mathrm{Finite}(\\mathcal C)\\land A\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal C)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC ideal definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc